        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>内分泌与代谢疾病手写笔记</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$'], ['\\\\(', '\\\\)']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$'], ['\\\\[', '\\\\]']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script defer src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    min-height: 100%;\n  }\n  body {\n    background:\n      repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, transparent 0 57px, rgba(255,255,255,.13) 58px 59px),\n      repeating-linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0 57px, rgba(255,255,255,.12) 58px 59px),\n      #15191c;\n    padding: 20px;\n    font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", \"FangSong\", \"SimSun\", serif;\n    color: #34322f;\n  }\n  .spread {\n    position: relative;\n    display: grid;\n    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) 40px minmax(0, 1fr);\n    width: 1120px;\n    height: 760px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    transform: rotate(-0.5deg);\n    filter: drop-shadow(0 4px 5px rgba(0,0,0,.55));\n  }\n  .page {\n    position: relative;\n    overflow: hidden;\n    padding: 25px 27px 22px 30px;\n    background-color: #e9e6d1;\n    background-image:\n      linear-gradient(rgba(117,135,119,.34) 1px, transparent 1px),\n      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(117,135,119,.34) 1px, transparent 1px);\n    background-size: 17px 17px;\n    border: 1px solid #aaa58f;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    line-height: 17px;\n    letter-spacing: .2px;\n  }\n  .left-page {\n    border-radius: 9px 2px 2px 9px;\n    box-shadow: inset -12px 0 15px rgba(91,82,59,.17);\n  }\n  .right-page {\n    border-radius: 2px 9px 9px 2px;\n    box-shadow: inset 12px 0 15px rgba(91,82,59,.16);\n  }\n  .content {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 2;\n  }\n  .line {\n    min-height: 17px;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n  .indent1 { padding-left: 17px; }\n  .indent2 { padding-left: 34px; }\n  .indent3 { padding-left: 51px; }\n  .red {\n    color: #a84653;\n  }\n  .purple {\n    color: #8b4c91;\n  }\n  .blue {\n    color: #526a99;\n  }\n  .title {\n    color: #9d4453;\n    text-decoration: underline;\n    text-decoration-thickness: 1px;\n    text-underline-offset: 2px;\n  }\n  .section {\n    color: #4e689b;\n    text-decoration: underline;\n    text-underline-offset: 2px;\n  }\n  .small {\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n  }\n  .tight {\n    letter-spacing: -0.5px;\n  }\n  .note {\n    display: inline-block;\n    transform: rotate(-1deg);\n  }\n  .binding {\n    position: relative;\n    z-index: 5;\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(82,77,60,.23), rgba(238,235,210,.8) 47%, rgba(75,69,53,.25));\n  }\n  .binding::before,\n  .binding::after {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 0;\n    bottom: 0;\n    width: 9px;\n    background: rgba(66,59,43,.18);\n  }\n  .binding::before { left: 0; }\n  .binding::after { right: 0; }\n  .rings {\n    position: absolute;\n    inset: 8px 0;\n    display: flex;\n    flex-direction: column;\n    justify-content: space-around;\n    align-items: center;\n  }\n  .ring {\n    position: relative;\n    width: 51px;\n    height: 13px;\n    border: 3px solid #797762;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: linear-gradient(#d7d3b9, #f3efd8 48%, #9d9980 52%, #dedac1);\n    box-shadow: 0 1px 1px rgba(0,0,0,.45);\n  }\n  .ring::after {\n    content: \"\";\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 17px;\n    top: 2px;\n    width: 14px;\n    height: 5px;\n    border-radius: 50%;\n    background: rgba(54,52,43,.45);\n  }\n  .edge-shadow-left {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 0;\n    top: 0;\n    width: 17px;\n    height: 100%;\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(59,51,36,.2));\n  }\n  .edge-shadow-right {\n    position: absolute;\n    left: 0;\n    top: 0;\n    width: 17px;\n    height: 100%;\n    background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(59,51,36,.2), transparent);\n  }\n  .margin-mark {\n    position: absolute;\n    color: #82545c;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    transform: rotate(-4deg);\n  }\n  .left-page .margin-mark {\n    right: 8px;\n    top: 310px;\n  }\n  .right-page .margin-mark {\n    left: 9px;\n    top: 460px;\n  }\n  @media (max-width: 1160px) {\n    body { padding: 8px; }\n    .spread {\n      transform-origin: top left;\n      transform: scale(calc((100vw - 16px) / 1120)) rotate(-0.5deg);\n      margin: 0;\n    }\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"spread\">\n  <section class=\"page left-page\">\n    <div class=\"edge-shadow-left\"></div>\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"small\">（1）动态血糖监测：受试者佩戴一个持续葡萄糖</span></div>\n      <div class=\"line indent1\"><span class=\"small\">监测系统，可连续监测皮下组织间液的葡萄糖浓度。</span></div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"small\">（2）指尖血糖监测：每日多次监测血糖。</span></div>\n      <div class=\"line indent1\"><span class=\"small\">有助于发现无症状性低血糖及血糖波动。</span></div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"purple\">三、其他检查</span></div>\n      <div class=\"line\">1. 糖化血红蛋白：反映取血前8～12周的平均血糖水平。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">2. 糖化血清蛋白：反映取血前2～3周的平均血糖水平。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">3. 血浆胰岛素和C肽测定。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">4. 尿糖及尿酮体测定。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"red title\">第十章　糖尿病病人的护理</span></div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"blue section\">一、护理评估</span></div>\n      <div class=\"line\">（一）健康史</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent1\">询问有无糖尿病家族史、感染、肥胖、妊娠及用药史。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">（二）身体状况</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent1\">1. 症状：多尿、多饮、多食、体重下降。</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent1\">2. 体征：皮肤干燥、瘙痒，伤口不易愈合。</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent1\">3. 并发症表现：[illegible]</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">（三）心理—社会状况</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent1\">评估病人对疾病的认识、情绪及家庭支持情况。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">（四）辅助检查</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent1\">血糖、尿糖、糖化血红蛋白及酮体检查。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"blue section\">二、护理诊断及合作性问题</span></div>\n      <div class=\"line small\">1. 营养失调：低于机体需要量　与胰岛素分泌或作用缺陷有关。</div>\n      <div class=\"line small\">2. 有感染的危险　与血糖增高、机体抵抗力下降有关。</div>\n      <div class=\"line small\">3. 潜在并发症：糖尿病酮症酸中毒、低血糖。</div>\n      <div class=\"line small\">4. 知识缺乏：缺乏糖尿病饮食、用药及自我监测知识。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"blue section\">三、护理目标</span></div>\n      <div class=\"line indent1\">病人血糖控制良好，无严重并发症，掌握自我护理方法。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"blue section\">四、护理措施</span></div>\n      <div class=\"line\">（一）饮食护理</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent1\">1. 控制总热量，合理分配碳水化合物、脂肪和蛋白质。</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent1\">2. 定时定量进餐，少量多餐。</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent1\">3. 限制甜食及含糖饮料，增加膳食纤维。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">（二）运动护理</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent1\">根据年龄和病情选择适宜运动，避免空腹运动。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">（三）用药护理</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent1\">遵医嘱使用降糖药或胰岛素，观察低血糖反应。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">（四）病情观察</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent1\">监测血糖、尿糖、生命体征及出入量。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">（五）健康指导</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent1\">指导足部护理、血糖监测及并发症预防。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">1. 尿微量白蛋白　　2. 眼底检查</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">3. 心电图　　　　　4. 肾小球滤过率</div>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"margin-mark\">[?]</span>\n  </section>\n\n  <div class=\"binding\" aria-label=\"[Notebook spiral binding: centered]\">\n    <div class=\"rings\">\n      <span class=\"ring\"></span><span class=\"ring\"></span><span class=\"ring\"></span>\n      <span class=\"ring\"></span><span class=\"ring\"></span><span class=\"ring\"></span>\n      <span class=\"ring\"></span><span class=\"ring\"></span><span class=\"ring\"></span>\n      <span class=\"ring\"></span><span class=\"ring\"></span><span class=\"ring\"></span>\n      <span class=\"ring\"></span><span class=\"ring\"></span><span class=\"ring\"></span>\n      <span class=\"ring\"></span><span class=\"ring\"></span><span class=\"ring\"></span>\n      <span class=\"ring\"></span><span class=\"ring\"></span><span class=\"ring\"></span>\n      <span class=\"ring\"></span><span class=\"ring\"></span><span class=\"ring\"></span>\n      <span class=\"ring\"></span><span class=\"ring\"></span><span class=\"ring\"></span>\n      <span class=\"ring\"></span><span class=\"ring\"></span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <section class=\"page right-page\">\n    <div class=\"edge-shadow-right\"></div>\n    <div class=\"content\">\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"blue section\">生理期激素调节异常和[?]</span></div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"red title\">内分泌与代谢疾病</span></div>\n      <div class=\"line\">激素的病理过程不同，[illegible]</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">其发生、发展属于多因素共同作用的结果。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"red\">糖尿病（Diabetes mellitus）</span>是由多种病因引起，</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">以慢性高血糖为特征的代谢性疾病，是由于胰岛素</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">分泌和（或）作用缺陷所引起。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"blue section\">一、病因与发病机制</span></div>\n      <div class=\"line\">1. 遗传因素</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">2. 胰岛素抵抗因素　3. 肥胖因素　4. 神经精神因素</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">2. 发病机制</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent1\">（1）胰岛β细胞破坏，胰岛素绝对缺乏。</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent1\">（2）胰岛素抵抗和胰岛素分泌不足。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"blue section\">二、代谢紊乱</span></div>\n      <div class=\"line\">1. 葡萄糖代谢紊乱：组织对葡萄糖利用减少，血糖升高。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">2. 脂肪代谢紊乱：脂肪分解增加，酮体生成增多。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">3. 蛋白质代谢紊乱：[illegible]</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">4. 水、电解质代谢紊乱。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"blue section\">三、慢性并发症发生机制</span></div>\n      <div class=\"line\">1. 多元醇通路活性增高。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">2. 蛋白激酶C活性增高。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">3. 糖化反应：糖基化终末产物直接损害组织细胞，</div>\n      <div class=\"line indent1\">促进糖尿病慢性并发症发生。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"blue section\">四、临床表现</span></div>\n      <div class=\"line\">典型表现：三多一少，皮肤瘙痒，尤其外阴瘙痒。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">部分病人以感染、视力减退或并发症为首发表现。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"red title\">（三）实验室检查</span></div>\n      <div class=\"line\">1. 尿糖测定</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">2. 血糖测定</div>\n      <div class=\"line small indent1\">空腹血糖受损：$6.1\\text{ mmol/L}\\leq$空腹血糖$&lt;7.0\\text{ mmol/L}$</div>\n      <div class=\"line small indent1\">糖耐量减低：$7.8\\text{ mmol/L}\\leq$餐后2h血糖$&lt;11.1\\text{ mmol/L}$</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">（1）空腹血糖：空腹血糖$\\geq7.0\\text{ mmol/L}$。</div>\n      <div class=\"line small\">（2）随机血糖或餐后2h血糖$\\geq11.1\\text{ mmol/L}$。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">3. 口服葡萄糖耐量试验</div>\n      <div class=\"line small indent1\">成人口服75g无水葡萄糖，测服糖前及服糖后2h血糖。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">4. 糖化血红蛋白测定。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">5. 血脂、肾功能及相关并发症检查。</div>\n      <div class=\"line\"><span class=\"purple note\">[illegible]</span></div>\n    </div>\n    <span class=\"margin-mark\">[?]</span>\n  </section>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>"
      },
      "finish_reason": "stop"
    }
